{
  "date": "2026-11-15",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "10月有5家银行因为金融科技问题被罚",
  "title_en": "In October, 5 banks were punished over fintech problems",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月14日，移动支付网引用“银行科技研究社”的数据报道，今年10月一共出现了5张跟金融科技有关的银行罚单。这些罚单上写的原因，是银行违反了金融科技管理方面的规定。",
      "en": "On November 14, Mpaypass, citing data from \"Bank Technology Research Society\", reported that a total of 5 bank penalty notices related to fintech appeared this October. The reason written on these notices was that the banks broke rules on fintech management."
    },
    {
      "zh": "被罚的5家银行里，有1家城市商业银行、3家农村商业银行和1家村镇银行。其中4家银行同时还有别的问题，只有那家村镇银行只是因为金融科技问题被罚。",
      "en": "Among the 5 banks that were punished, there was 1 city commercial bank, 3 rural commercial banks and 1 village bank. Four of them also had other problems at the same time; only the village bank was punished just for the fintech problem."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在这5张罚单中，有2张是“双罚”，也就是银行和个人都被处罚。一张罚单要求村镇银行的董事长负责任；还有一家农商行支行的科技部门负责人被罚款。",
      "en": "Of these 5 notices, 2 were \"double penalties\", meaning both the bank and a person were punished. One notice held the village bank's chairman responsible; in another case, the head of the technology department at a rural commercial bank sub-branch was fined."
    },
    {
      "zh": "从数量上看，今年1月到4月，每个月都有10张以上这样的罚单。最近半年，多数月份不超过5张，9月是9张。很多罚单没有写清楚银行具体做错了什么。",
      "en": "In terms of numbers, from January to April this year there were more than 10 such notices every month. In the last six months, most months had no more than 5, and September had 9. Many notices did not say clearly what exactly the bank did wrong."
    }
  ],
